ause both persisted structures are built from the same (:ranked-actions judge-output) collection, so the ids line up by construction." :assigned "2026-09-01 by claude-20 as I1/I2 orchestrating owner. ORDERING-NEUTRAL: this write is required under every option J3 offers, so it does not wait on J3 (claude-1 concurs; the reading is in the J3 thread)."
